  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 906.03 Discontinued Business. If a licensed business discontinues operation while merchandise is in transit, the transportation agent shall return the merchandise to the warehouse of origin.\n\nSource. #4720, eff 1-1-90; ss by #5043, eff 1-11-91; ss by #6391, eff 11-28-96, EXPIRED: 11-28-04\n\nNew. #9227, eff 8-6-08, EXPIRED: 8-6-16\n\nNew. #12210, eff 6-14-17; ss by #13225, eff 6-30-21",
